/*! \mainpage Ion Beam Simulation Package

IBSimu is a simulation package for ion beam optics with space charge
and plasma modelling capabilities.

The manual consists of the reference manual and an \subpage p_intro
"introduction", which describes the different concepts in the
simulations in couple of pages.  The reference manual describes the
classes, functions and variables of the IBSimu package in detail, but
first time users should first read the introduction to get a grasp of
the parts of the package and how they relate to each other.

 
